      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woho, amwanta naHamani hiyakuya nakunwa namwadi Esita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku damu chiyedi chadiŋi nakunwawu vinyu, mwanta hakumwila cheŋi Esita, nindi, Eyi mwadi Esita wunakeŋidi? Akakwinka hohu. Wunakeŋi kulombadi? Akachikoŋa hohu hela chashikila muchibalu chawanta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwadi Esita hakwakula nindi, Eyi mwanta, neyi nawani wuselewakumesu eyi, neyi mwanta natiyi kuwaha, nakeŋi nami anyinki wumi wami, nalombi nami anyinki antaŋa jami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa tulanda dehi, ninaminiantaŋa jami, nawu atujilumuni, atujahi, atunoŋeshi. Neyi akumina dakutulanda kwamuwuduŋu twi kali anduŋu amayala nawambanda, nadi kudi mwenena tuhu kwami, hela chenochu ntahi, mukwankunyi wadikumufuntishila cheŋi mwanta yuma yanamubondiyi wanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Ahasuwenausi hakuhosha, hakumwihula mwadi Esita, nindi, Hinyi yenowu? Wekala kudihi yenowu? Wabula woma wakufuukula mumuchima windikwila mwenomu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esita nindi, iyala mukwankunyi chilumbu, yoyeni wuHamani watamiwu. Hamani otiya niwoma kumesu amwanta namwadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
